{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"84642c89-e347-466c-bef9-87224a7508ee","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have resolved the interdependent state, cache-invalidation, defensive-copy, and monetary-rounding bugs across all four modules:\n\n- **[store.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-007_27144_1795167470340_baseline/store.py)** (`TenantStore`):\n  - Stored `unit_rate` and `discount_rate` as `Decimal` values from `TIER_CATALOG`.\n  - Updated `upsert_tenant`, `update_tenant_tier`, and `record_usage` to increment `version` on mutations and invoke all registered invalidation hooks (`(tenant_id, None)` for tenant/tier updates and `(tenant_id, period)` for usage updates).\n  - Enforced `Decimal`-based non-negative validation on `units` and `unit_rate` in `record_usage`.\n  - Returned defensive deep copies from `get_tenant`, `get_snapshot`, and mutation methods so caller mutations cannot corrupt internal store state.\n\n- **[cache.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-007_27144_1795167470340_baseline/cache.py)** (`InvoiceCache`):\n  - Stored entries with their `resolved_version` (`version if version is not None else invoice.get(\"version\", 1)`) and defensive `copy.deepcopy` on both `set` and `get`.\n  - Checked `version` in `get(tenant_id, period, version=...)`, returning `None` on version mismatch.\n  - Updated `invalidate(tenant_id, period=None)` to remove either a single `(tenant_id, period)` entry or all cached periods for `tenant_id` when `period is None`, returning the exact count of removed entries.\n\n- **[billing.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-007_27144_1795167470340_baseline/billing.py)** (`calculate_invoice`):\n  - Replaced binary float arithmetic with `Decimal` conversion (`Decimal(str(value))`) and `quantize_money` (`Decimal(\"0.01\")` with `ROUND_HALF_UP`).\n  - Checked `cached_invoice` against `(tenant_id, period, version)` of `snapshot`, returning a defensive deep copy without re-applying discounts when valid, and recomputing authoritatively from `snapshot` when `None` or stale.\n\n- **[api.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-007_27144_1795167470340_baseline/api.py)** (`BillingAPI`):\n  - Registered `cache.invalidate` as a store invalidation hook in `BillingAPI.__init__`.\n  - Updated `preview_invoice` to query and populate `cache` using `version=snapshot[\"version\"]` and return defensive deep copies.\n  - Ensured `record_usage` and `change_tier_and_preview` invalidate affected cache entries and return fresh previews.\n","duration_seconds":151.2541187,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":51892,"output_tokens":10643,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":274389,"total_tokens":62535}}}
